OL,3,GNEWSAIpswich Town to save Suffolk Punch
OL,4,Ahorse charity
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity which protects the critically
OL,7,Fendangered Suffolk Punch horse breed is
OL,8,Fto be saved by Ipswich Town FC.
OL,10,FThe horse has featured on the club's
OL,11,Fbadge for more than 50 years and news
OL,12,Fthe Suffolk Punch Trust may soon cease
OL,13,Fto exist hit fans hard.
OL,15,FThe trust closed its visitor centre,
OL,16,Fcafe and shop due to high costs in
OL,17,FFebruary and later put its 120-acre
OL,18,Ffarm and visitor centre on the market
OL,19,Ffor #2.4m.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,380,370,200,160,0,100
