OL,3,GNEWSAIpswich Town to save Suffolk Punch
OL,4,Ahorse charity
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We carry the Suffolk Punch on our
OL,7,Fcrest... and this has been one that
OL,8,Fpeople have been keen for us to support
OL,9,Fand it's the right thing to do," said
OL,10,FMark Ashton, chairman and chief
OL,11,Fexecutive of the Premier League side.
